<!-- 伴宠工单处理弹层（需补充 / 拒绝）：理由必填，快选可叠加后再改；不用原生弹窗 -->
<view class="modal-mask pm-sheet-mask" wx:if="{{petSheet.show}}" bindtap="closePetSheet">
  <view class="modal-panel pm-sheet" catchtap="noop">
    <view class="modal-head"><text>{{petSheet.title}}</text><view class="close-btn" hover-class="tap-press" hover-stay-time="80" bindtap="closePetSheet">✕</view></view>
    <view class="modal-body pm-sheet-body">
      <text class="pm-sheet-order">{{petSheet.petName}} · {{petSheet.orderNo}}</text>
      <text class="pm-sheet-label">常用{{petSheet.mode === 'decline' ? '理由' : '补充项'}}（点选后可再修改）</text>
      <view class="pm-chips">
        <view wx:for="{{petSheet.chips}}" wx:key="*this" class="pm-chip" hover-class="tap-press-soft" hover-stay-time="80" bindtap="pickPetSheetChip" data-text="{{item}}">{{item}}</view>
      </view>
      <textarea class="pm-sheet-input {{petSheet.error ? 'has-error' : ''}}" value="{{petSheet.text}}" maxlength="{{petSheet.max}}" placeholder="{{petSheet.placeholder}}" placeholder-class="pm-sheet-ph" bindinput="onPetSheetInput" disabled="{{petSheet.busy}}" auto-height="{{false}}" />
      <view class="pm-sheet-foot-line">
        <text class="pm-sheet-error" wx:if="{{petSheet.error}}">{{petSheet.error}}</text>
        <text class="pm-sheet-hint" wx:else>{{petSheet.hint}}</text>
        <text class="pm-sheet-count">{{petSheet.len || 0}}/{{petSheet.max}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="modal-foot pm-sheet-actions">
      <view class="pm-btn sub" hover-class="tap-press" hover-stay-time="80" bindtap="closePetSheet">取消</view>
      <view class="pm-btn main {{petSheet.busy ? 'is-busy' : ''}}" hover-class="tap-press" hover-stay-time="80" bindtap="submitPetSheet">{{petSheet.busy ? '处理中…' : petSheet.confirmText}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
<!-- /伴宠工单处理弹层 -->
